  "verbalization": "The visible evidence suggests a potential relationship between Npc216413 and SQ20B through a series of target interactions. Npc216413 is implicated in the target of VMRC-LCP, which is itself a target of Cocosamide B. Cocosamide B further targets SQ20B, forming a chain of interactions that links Npc216413 to SQ20B. Similarly, Npc216413 is also linked to VMRC-LCP, which is a target of another compound, (4S,5S)-5-[(1R,2R)-2-Hydroxy-2-Methyl-5-Oxocyclopent-3-En-1-Yl]-3-Methylidene-4-(3-Oxobutyl)Oxolan-2-One, which also targets SQ20B. These findings indicate that Npc216413 is part of a broader network of targets that ultimately lead to SQ20B. The scores for these relationships are consistent, suggesting a plausible biological pathway. However, the exact nature of the interactions and their functional significance remain to be fully elucidated.",
